  "_help": "Character models (scripts/Avatar.cs). Bodies, hair and outfit parts share one skeleton, so gear parts deform with the body. Gear is matched by keywords in the item name (first match wins). 'parts' are outfit glTF names in assets/models/outfit ({s} = Male/Female). 'tint' multiplies the part colours. 'proc' = no model yet, a procedural shape is used. Weapons: model is grip-at-origin, blade along +Z; 'len' is the length in metres. Trinkets are never shown.",
